{
 "format": "dpmg-mission/1",
 "name": "Pair G40, both ways in turn: G40-AX3G and G40-AX35, ground on two jacks",
 "notes": "7 comm waveforms, each sent down and then up. Down: G40-AX3G keys on TRx2B through the HPA at TX attenuation 10 dB for 13 s and G40-AX35 decodes on TRx1A. Up: G40-AX35 keys on TRx1B into the ground HPA at TX attenuation 30 dB for 13 s and G40-AX3G decodes on TRx1A through the payload RX chain, RX attenuator 0 dB. G40-AX35 receives on TRx1A and transmits on TRx1B, each on its own antenna. Both radios are set to their two jacks in the first minute and are not re-initialized between the directions. Starts on Run mission: the first downlink keys at 01:08, the first uplink at 01:29, the last step ends at 05:54. Set the ground TX attenuation for the ground HPA before keying.",
 "authorization": {
  "reference": "FLIGHT-2026-11",
  "note": "open air: the payload on its antenna, the ground G40 on its own TX and RX antennas"
 },
